 "edits": [
  {
   "path": "sections.analysis.1.zh",
   "before": "扔钥匙没有补上任何一个漏洞。它针对的是人：石亨怕的是还没动手就背上谋反罪名，钥匙一没，收手关门这条路就断了，剩下的只有往前走。一种理解是，这一扔压住了同伴最危险的犹豫；但它也把一次可能的收手机会一并扔掉了。",
   "after": "扔钥匙没有补上任何一个漏洞。它针对的是人：石亨怕的是还没动手就背上谋反罪名。城门此前已经关上，钥匙一没，城门就再打不开，这一千人也退不出去，收手这条路就断了，剩下的只有往前走。一种理解是，这一扔压住了同伴最危险的犹豫；但它也把一次可能的收手机会一并扔掉了。",
   "issues": [
    "F6"
   ]
  },
  {
   "path": "sections.analysis.1.en",
   "before": "Throwing away the key filled none of the holes in the plan. It was aimed at people. Shi Heng's fear was being branded a traitor before anything had been done. With the key gone, the option of calling it off and locking the gate went with it, and only the road forward remained. One reading is that the throw crushed the most dangerous hesitation among Xu's partners. But it also threw away a possible chance to pull back.",
   "after": "Throwing away the key filled none of the holes in the plan. It was aimed at people. Shi Heng's fear was being branded a traitor before anything had been done. The gate had already been shut behind the troops. With the key gone, the gate could not be reopened to send the men back out, so calling it off was no longer possible, and only the road forward remained. One reading is that the throw crushed the most dangerous hesitation among Xu's partners. But it also threw away a possible chance to pull back.",
   "issues": [
    "F6"
   ]
  }
 ],
